      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay i understand. but it's late and my doctor's office is closed and the wait for the urgent care line is like an hour. i really dont want to drive her all the way there just for a fever if i can help it. is there like a safe amount of aspirin or maybe some other adult medication i could split up for her to help her sleep? she's just so miserable right now.",
